<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello </span>{!Contact.FirstName}<span style="font-size: 12pt;">,&nbsp;</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">As you are aware, we have issued a legal demand on the account due to </span>{!Case.FRPSA_Breach__c}<span style="font-size: 12pt;">.&nbsp;</span></font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We have been attempting to come to a resolution regarding your account. If you do not contact us the account will be reported to business credit as a defaulted account and the file will be sent to our litigation team for evaluation and handling.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To help avoid that outcome, we would like to offer you some options to settle the account prior to possible litigation.&nbsp; Please contact us as soon as possible so we can work together to resolve the defaulted account.&nbsp; We look forward to hearing from you.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Thank you,</span></span></span></span></div><div style=""><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Case_Email_Signature_Name_Formula__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of</span></b><br style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Quick Bridge Funding, LLC</b></span></font></p></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div><div style=""><font face="arial">P: {!Case.OwnerPhone}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" size="1">{!Case.Email_Thread_ID__c}</font></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>